    {
      "Original": "Opens the BeastieBuddy monster search window.",
      "Translated": "打开 BeastieBuddy 怪物搜索窗口。",
      "Context": "Plugin..ctor",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek"
    },
    {
      "Original": "BeastieBuddy standalone is here!\nFFXIV ToS-compliant. No Dalamud or game interaction. Works on patch days!\nCode + SHA-256: https://github.com/rail2025/BeastieBuddy-App/\nSmartScreen may warn. Free. Click the icon or this link!",
      "Translated": "BeastieBuddy 独立版来了！\n符合 FFXIV 服务条款。无需 Dalamud 或游戏任务指令。补丁日也能用！\n代码 + SHA-256：https://github.com/rail2025/BeastieBuddy-App/\nSmartScreen 可能会警告。免费。点击图标或此链接！",
      "Context": "Plugin.AnnounceStandaloneApp",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek"
    },
    {
      "Original": "BeastieBuddy Standalone App",
      "Translated": "BeastieBuddy 独立应用",
